        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Standard Duty Commercial One-Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nSatin chrome finished One-Sided Commercial Deadbolt with universal adjustable backset and 1 inch throw bolt uses thumbturn inside with an exterior plate to cover exposed door prep on the outside. \r\n<br>Fit standard 161 door prep, 2-1/8\" pre drilled doors. Includes reinforced strike plate and adjustable backset deadbolt for easy installation on wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/commercial-one-sided-deadbolt-pdq-kv125-626\"><b>Commercial One-Sided Deadbolt</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/satin-chrome-standard-duty-commercial-deadbolt-pdq-kv-series\"><b>Standard Duty Commercial Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nU.L., U.L.C. Listed, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, UL10B Neutral Pressure Rated.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for PDQ KV125BK-626 Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-1/4\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 2-1/8\" door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt:: 1\" throw with case-hardened roller pin. Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 2-3/4\" x 1-1/8\". Brass</li>\r\n<li>Trim Material: Wrought Brass</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>626 - Brushed Chrome Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. Exterior plate covers exposed door preparation on the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
